<% content_for :title, "Privacy Policy" %>
<p><strong>Minha Automação</strong> (part of Minha Suite) automates homes, stores and factories: devices, sensors,
   scenes, notifications and the history of what happened. This policy explains what data we keep, why, and how to delete it.</p>
<h2>1. What we keep</h2>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Account:</strong> name, e-mail, password (only its hash) or the link to your Google account, and your role in the home.</li>
  <li><strong>Your home or installation:</strong> registration details and, as you add them, places, devices, automations
      and the history of readings and events.</li>
  <li><strong>Notifications:</strong> a device identifier used to send alerts.</li>
</ul>
<h2>2. Why</h2>
<p>Only to run the service. Each installation works in an isolated space; we do not sell or share your data with advertisers.</p>
<h2>3. Who we share it with</h2>
<ul>
  <li><strong>AI provider (Google, Anthropic or OpenAI):</strong> only when you use an AI feature, and only the text
      that feature needs.</li>
  <li><strong>Infrastructure:</strong> server and file storage (Cloudflare R2).</li>
</ul>
<h2>4. Security</h2>
<p>Always-encrypted connections (HTTPS), hashed passwords (bcrypt), short-lived access tokens and an audit
   trail for the account.</p>
<h2>5. Your rights</h2>
<p>You can export your data, reset the home's data or delete your account in the app or on the website. See <a href="/exclusao">Data deletion</a>.
   Questions: <a href="mailto:herlonfilgueira@gmail.com">herlonfilgueira@gmail.com</a>.</p>
